  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Founded in 1993, the EURASIA Institute for International Education (EIIE) is the oldest and most trusted provider of academic and language pathways for German universities.</p><p>The Institute is registered with the Berlin Senate for Education, Science and Research, and is an accredited test centre for all university entrance exams.</p><p>It has students from more than 100 countries and offers pathways for Bachelor’s, Master’s and PhD students. With EURASIA's Smart Genius German Language Pathways, you can select from more than 400 universities.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At EURASIA Institute, you’ll be in a multicultural environment with students from around 100 countries. In fact, through EIIE’s language learning pathways, you not only learn the German language but also understand more of the German culture by interacting with fellow learners and the native people. The Institute also organises excursions to nearby places such as Potsdam, the Spreewald and other universities.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>EURASIA Institute offers the opportunity to stay with a German homestay or in a shared student apartment and works with providers associated with them. You can also choose to stay at the EIIE’s hostel, which is just 15 minutes away by public transport.</p><p>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\">download our app</a> and check out the Stays feature!</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>The university canteen offers a wide range of food options, including vegetarian and halal dishes, catering to different dietary preferences.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
